# Deployment-level overrides. The template stays empty.
# Machine settings belong in machine.env, secrets in secrets.env and behavior
# in config/personal.toml; their values win over this file. Add only operator
# overrides that have no home there, such as the range persistence version
# pins read by services/breakouts/config.py (RANGE_PERSISTENCE_VERSION and
# RANGE_PERSISTENCE_VALIDATION_VERSION).
